me, fortune-telling and the Stable all reset on Sunday. Use them before the week turns.","sections":[{"label":"Before","text":"Sunday each week"}],"categories":{}}},{"block":"story","slug":"prologue-descent","position":0,"content":{"name":"Prologue: Descent","source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"Create Eshmel, meet Hong Hua and Troy. \"The White Bird\" and \"The Ruined Land\".","sections":[],"categories":{},"order":0}},{"block":"story","slug":"part-i-cais-path","position":1,"content":{"name":"Part I: Cai's Path","routes":["cai"],"source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"12 chapters, starting in Ribeira. Cai can capture mounts and farm.","sections":[],"categories":{},"order":1}},{"block":"story","slug":"part-i-dietrichs-path","position":2,"content":{"name":"Part I: Dietrich's Path","routes":["dietrich"],"source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"12 chapters, starting with a stranger arriving in Dagda. Dietrich fights Dread Warrior duels.","sections":[],"categories":{},"order":1}},{"block":"story","slug":"part-i-theodoras-path","position":3,"content":{"name":"Part I: Theodora's Path","routes":["theodora"],"source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"12 chapters, starting at the Iron Bastion. Theodora commands battalions.","sections":[],"categories":{},"order":1}},{"block":"story","slug":"part-i-ledas-path","position":4,"content":{"name":"Part I: Leda's Path","routes":["leda"],"source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"12 chapters, starting with \"The Vengeful Dancer\". Leda performs to learn Songs.","sections":[],"categories":{},"order":1}},{"block":"story","slug":"part-ii-war-arc","position":5,"content":{"name":"Part II: War Arc","spoiler":true,"source":