and pass the Certification Exam next to the vendor. Go in with a pass chance of 75% or more.","sections":[{"label":"Steps","text":"Buy the license from the License Vendor in Hightown\nTake the Certification Exam from the Exam Proctor next to him\nAim for a 75%+ pass chance"},{"label":"Tip","text":"The game autosaves before showing the result. Advanced classes unlocked on one route open on every route."}],"categories":{}}},{"block":"how-to","slug":"earn-temple-blessings","position":2,"content":{"name":"Earn Temple Blessings","source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"Send up to two units to Temple Service at Temple Row, best on a god's holy day, then equip up to four Blessings.","sections":[{"label":"Steps","text":"Do Temple Service at Temple Row (up to 2 units, costs Motivation)\nServe on a god's holy day to fill the gauge faster (see the Calendar)\nEquip up to 4 Blessings"},{"label":"Tip","text":"Fortuna's Blessing rewinds turns: free on Normal, 5 Divine Sand on Hard."}],"categories":{}}},{"block":"how-to","slug":"carry-progress-between-routes","position":3,"content":{"name":"Carry progress between routes","source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"Finish one route before starting the next: your map, finished subquests, Blessings, supports and Boons carry over.","sections":[{"label":"Steps","text":"Finish a route before starting the next\nYour map, finished subquests, Blessings, supports and Boons carry forward\nReplaying Chapter 12 updates the party that route takes into Part II"},{"label":"Tip","text":"Finished general subquests auto-complete on later routes and pay their rewards again."}],"categories":{}}},{"block":"how-to","slug":"find-dagsions-services","position":4,"content":{"name":"Find Dagsion's services","source":"Fortune's Weave Codex (Sept 18, 2026): Game8, RPG Site, Polygon, IGN, fan wikis","description":"Classes and the temple are in Hightown, the Headhunter in Midtown, the Tavern, Stable and trading in Lowtown, and Temple Service on Temple Row.","sections":[{"label":"Steps","text":"Hightown: classes and Smyrnos's Temple\nMidtown: Headhunter and fortune-telling\nLowtown: Tavern, Stable, trading\nTemple Row: Temple Service"},{"label":"Tip","text":"The Theater and Thermae raise Support; Inns serve meals and support conversations."}],"categories":{}}}]$seed$::jsonb) loop
    cid := null;
    values ('fortunes-weave', e->>'block', e->>'slug', (e->>'position')::int)
    on conflict (game_id, block_key, slug) do nothing returning id into cid;
    continue when cid is null;  -- already there: leave the community's edits alone
  end loop;
end $$;

-- ocarina-of-time
on conflict (game_id, page_key) do update set title = excluded.title, short = excluded.short, icon = excluded.icon,
  tint = excluded.tint, blurb = excluded.blurb, position = excluded.position;

on conflict (game_id, block_key) do update set title = excluded.title, position = excluded.position,
  page_key = excluded.page_key, type = excluded.type, look = excluded.look, icon = excluded.icon, intro = excluded.intro,
  filters = excluded.filters, by_route = excluded.by_route, stat_name = excluded.stat_name, stats = excluded.stats, symbols = excluded.symbols,
  fields = coalesce(public.game_blocks.fields, excluded.fields), tier_setup = coalesce(public.game_blocks.tier_setup, excluded.tier_setup),
  plan_setup = coalesce(public.game_blocks.plan_setup, excluded.plan_setup);

-- Old blocks the Pages replaced, when they have no entries. A Block taken off its Page with
-- entries (Mysteries) keeps them and their history, so it stays, just out of the app.
delete from public.game_blocks b where b.page_key is null and not exists (select 1 from public.cards c where c.game_id = b.game_id and c.block_key = b.block_key);
